    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Sound designer / commercial music producer, London. His core work is music and sound for fashion and brand campaigns: Miu Miu (multiple), Prada, Nike, Alexander McQueen, PlayStation, Rapha, Diesel, Adidas, Lanvin and more (videos embedded). Also runs GETME! (thisisgetme.com, est. 2006), a music/audio agency and NTS radio show, with a background as A&R at Warner Music and music/culture programmer at Mixcloud. Capability: sound design (composition and music for media). Portfolio is video/audio (embedded YouTube/Vimeo per project + SoundCloud + NTS), the right medium for his work. Instagram @thisislixo. Work Status: Studio (runs GETME); self-maintained site, current.",
